{
  "batch_id": "s1:batch:0006",
  "translations": [
    {
      "line_id": "s1:00398",
      "en": "Probably the knights who admired Levia,",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:00399",
      "en": "Ranzabu likely had a hand in it.",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:00405",
      "en": "Ranzabu bowed politely to Levia as she turned,",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:00406",
      "en": "then resumed his position behind Levia.",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:00409",
      "en": "So, you're going to that mansion now?",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:00412",
      "en": "Yeah.",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:00415",
      "en": "Then go ahead, I'll find us an inn.",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:00418",
      "en": "If that's the case...",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:00419",
      "en": "No, you're right. Understood...",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:00424",
      "en": "Levia briefly looks wounded, then turns away.",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:00425",
      "en": "She shows a slightly dejected expression,",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:00426",
      "en": "then in the next moment, she leaves.",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:00428",
      "en": "I understand what Levia wanted to say.",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:00429",
      "en": "They probably have rooms prepared for us there.",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:00430",
      "en": "But sorry, Levia, I'd rather not get",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:00431",
      "en": "dragged into needless trouble.",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:00433",
      "en": "Because Levia understands that as well,",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:00434",
      "en": "she left without saying anything.",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:00444",
      "en": "Shuri stares intently at Levia leaving.",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:00447",
      "en": "Miss Levia...",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:00449",
      "en": "Levia, though a woman, holds the rank of general,",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:00450",
      "en": "and always shoulders needless trouble for it.",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:00452",
      "en": "Shuri, ignorant of the military, cannot grasp",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:00453",
      "en": "and that reminds her of her own powerlessness.",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:00454",
      "en": "On Shuri's face watching Levia leave,",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:00455",
      "en": "a look of concern for her appears.",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:00457",
      "en": "So much for a slow recovery.",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:00460",
      "en": "It's fine...",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:00463",
      "en": "Master?",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:00466",
      "en": "...",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:00469",
      "en": "You're right.",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:00471",
      "en": "Though my words were few, that one line",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:00472",
      "en": "seems to have eased Shuri's anxiety a bit.",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:00477",
      "en": "Shuri turns back to me, waiting for my words.",
      "notes": ""
    }
  ],
